Height follows the original aspect ratio, and both are rounded to even numbers.
Up to <b>$((src_w * 4))</b> px (4× the original) stays sharp with 4× models; beyond a model's scale it's stretched.
<i>$NEAREST</i> uses whole multiples (2×, 3×…) of the original, rounding down, with no upper limit.
